no, tu non ne hai uno?"},{"language":"en-US","overview":"Mauro is a surfer used to challenging the ocean’s most massive waves. However, an accident forces him into a long rehabilitation, distancing him from the sea and the life he loved.  While at the clinic, he meets Federico, a young athlete suffering from ataxia and confined to a wheelchair, yet possessed of an extraordinary life force.  An unexpected friendship blossoms between them, leading Mauro to make an impulsive decision: to escape the routine and set off with Federico on an unconventional journey.  It is a trip that will become a quest for freedom, identity, and rebirth."}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/sjSSRN3ZpkyFOdyQsKssoGoOF2G.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/2uAorKEEVG6grAsnc9w9PVGI3P9.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":1591391,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"it-IT","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/sjSSRN3ZpkyFOdyQsKssoGoOF2G.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/sjSSRN3ZpkyFOdyQsKssoGoOF2G.jpg","language":"it","width":1890,"height":2835},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/sjSSRN3ZpkyFOdyQsKssoGoOF2G.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/sjSSRN3ZpkyFOdyQsKssoGoOF2G.jpg","language":"it","width":1890,"height":2835},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/w3zinw8Hy9YfiqQvAMdGOZXrATX.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/w3zinw8Hy9YfiqQvAMdGOZXrATX.jpg","language":"it","width":1000,"height":1500}]},"en":{"status":"missing","candidates":[]},"xx":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/vyBoaFhPqvC49PUnOdldisMpohU.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/vyBoaFhPqvC49PUnOdldisMpohU.jpg","language":"xx","width":1984,